<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>If you're looking for a game fence builder in Waco, TX, you want somebody who's built high fence on real ranch country, not just backyard privacy fence. Brazos Ridge Fence Co. installs 8-foot net-wire game fence across McLennan, Bosque, and Falls counties for landowners running whitetail, exotics, or both. Most of our game fence runs $4.50 to $10 per linear foot installed, which works out to roughly $25,000 to $50,000 per mile depending on terrain and wire class.</p><p>A high fence is a big check, so we put everything in writing before a single post goes in the ground. You'll get a walked line, a per-foot price, and a clear number for any <strong>fence line clearing</strong> the job needs. If you're still comparing options, our <a href="/ranch-fence-cost/">ranch fence cost guide</a> breaks down game fence against <a href="/barbed-wire-fence-waco/">barbed wire</a> and other styles so you can see where your money goes.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Handle</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What's Included in Every Visit</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">8-Foot Net-Wire Construction</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Full 96-inch fixed-knot or hinge-joint net wire that whitetail and most exotics can't clear. We stretch it tight and keep it tight.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Heavy Corner and Brace Assemblies</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">H-braces and pipe corners set in concrete carry the load of a mile of stretched wire. Weak corners are why cheap game fences sag in three years.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Built for Deer and Exotics</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Wire spacing and height matched to what you're holding, from whitetail and axis to blackbuck and aoudad. Smaller mesh down low keeps fawns and exotics from slipping through.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Fence Line Clearing</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We clear cedar, mesquite, and brush along the line before we build, priced separately so you only pay for what your land needs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Game-Proof Gates and Entrances</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Tall wire gates, cattle guards, and custom entrances that don't become the hole in your high fence. We build them to the same height as the line.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Free Written Estimates</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We walk your line, measure it, and hand you a written per-foot price. No guessing, no surprise change orders halfway through the job.</p>
      </div>
</div>
